    "body": "With the release of v0.51.0, we updated Starship to only set `$PROMPT` once, at initialization, whereas we would previously re-set it every render.\r\n\r\nThis means that shells that were previously having their Starship prompt overridden would later be re-overridden by Starship. As a result, previously misconfigured prompts that shouldn't have worked are now no longer working.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
