    "body": "@matchai - I did a clean install of Pop!_OS, and installed ```zsh``` fresh using ```sudo apt-get install zsh```, ran ```zsh``` and accepted the default config. I then installed ```starship``` using the ```curl``` method on the website, and appended the necessary ```eval \"$(starship init zsh)\"``` to my ```.zshrc```. In all steps I simply used the default settings/configs. Is there a misconfiguration in the default ```.zshrc```? I'm not trying to be combative here, I just want to understand what settings in the defaults are leading to the issue. Is it a fundamental issue with ```zsh```?",
