    "updated_at": "2021-03-31T22:10:01Z",
    "body": "Previously we didn't need to worry about this because the ZSH adapter scripts sort of brute-forced steamrolled existing prompts by setting `PROMPT` on every draw. This meant that it could ignore the ZSH prompt system, with the downside that it ignored the ZSH prompt system.\r\n\r\nPerhaps now that we've merged #2428 (which I'm pretty sure is the root cause of this issue), we need to bump #1994 up in priority.",
